1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
On a morning like every morning in Medina…

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,000
The city was still asleep. But some hearts were awake before the sun.

3
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:46,000
The call of the adhan woke Medina. And everyone set out for the masjid.

4
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:28,000
The rows stood as one body. Before them, the light of the Messenger of Allah ﷺ.

5
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:33,000
Everyone went to their own work. But some do good when no one sees them.

6
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:02,000
When they returned to the masjid, they sat around the Messenger of Allah ﷺ, as every day.

7
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:23,000
That day, he asked them a few questions.

8
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Who among you fasted today?

9
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:58,000
I did.

10
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:10,000
Who among you followed a funeral today?

11
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:28,000
I did.

12
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:40,000
Who among you fed a poor person today?

13
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:58,000
I did.

14
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Who among you visited a sick person today?

15
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:26,000
I did.

16
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:46,000
These deeds never come together in one person except that he enters Paradise.

17
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:42,000
Umar wondered: “What does he do in secret that I do not?”

18
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:05,000
And he decided: tomorrow, before dawn, he would follow him.

19
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:46,000
May Allah reward you, stranger. May Allah reward you.

20
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:57,000
Every morning. Without a word. Without a witness.

21
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:21,000
I will never be able to outdo you in goodness.

22
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:56,000
Years passed. And one day, Abu Bakr returned to his Lord.

23
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:22,000
These dates are not like the others… Who are you?

24
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:29,000
The one who came before me… has gone to Allah.

25
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:34,000
It was Abu Bakr… wasn't it?

26
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:39,000
Yes, mother. It was him.

27
00:11:52,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Do good in secret.

